  "editor_metadata": {
    "notes": "Mirrors the shipped legacy frog (FrogAgent + ten state nodes). The legacy Prepare and Hop states are folded into the Hop module. Numbers are the game's values and are checked by check_godot_contract.py; the two entries under source_binding.unsupported are the parts Schema V1 cannot express exactly.",
